sequenceDiagram
  actor Dev as Developer
  participant PubInt as Arm-Debug/ASTL
  participant Priv as Arm-Debug/ASTL-confidential
  participant Checks as GitHub Checks
  participant OSS as Arm/ASTL
  participant Art as Internal Artifact Store

  Dev->>PubInt: Push commits A, B, C
  Dev->>PubInt: Open pull request

  PubInt->>PubInt: Run public-safe CI
  PubInt->>PubInt: Run IP sensitivity checks

  PubInt-->>Priv: PR event / webhook / GitHub App trigger
  Priv->>PubInt: Checkout PR head SHA
  Priv->>Priv: Overlay NDA configs and private test fixtures
  Priv->>Priv: Run confidential CI flows
  Priv-->>Checks: Report internal check results to PR

  PubInt-->>Checks: Report public CI + IP check results
  Checks-->>PubInt: Required checks pass

  PubInt->>PubInt: Merge PR to main as commit M
  PubInt->>OSS: Mirror commit M to Arm/ASTL

  alt Release requested
    Priv->>PubInt: Checkout release tag or merged commit M
    Priv->>Priv: Build compiled content
    Priv->>Priv: Add internal configs
    Priv->>Art: Publish internal release package
    PubInt->>OSS: Optionally publish public-safe package
  end
